etailer sales, ±40% row count, previous 8 weeks. Any store outside its range flags the run.</p></fieldset>}<p className="text-xs text-slate-400">Delimiter applies to CSV/TSV/Text; encoding applies to text/JSON. Excel uses its first worksheet. JSON uses keys and requires Header Row 1. Changing parsing settings makes the previous sample stale until uploaded again.</p><div className="flex justify-end gap-3"><button type="button" className={button} disabled={busy} onClick={()=>{setDraft(null);setPassword('');}}>Cancel</button><button className={button+' bg-cyan-600'} disabled={busy}>Save Input File</button></div></form>}
